        "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/86ee0e90dfc63df9746bdfb6d45d1731.avif?t=1782798609\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras_big/86ee0e90dfc63df9746bdfb6d45d1731.avif?t=1782798609 width=800 height=281 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎉 <strong>Join Our Official Discord for Exclusive Perks!</strong> 🎉</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Special Rewards</strong> – Only for our Discord members! <br>🤝 <strong>Direct Access to Developers</strong> – Get quick feedback and updates! <br>🌍 <strong>Connect with Global Players</strong> – Find your perfect party worldwide! <br>🎮 <strong>Explore the Backrooms Together</strong> – Team up with new friends for thrilling adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/bfc7ad4f0fbc6477b8b7c52ea37858c1.avif?t=1782798609\" width=276 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t miss out on these community-only perks! Join the fun and become part of the Backroom Company family today! 👾💬</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“This place cannot be explained with logic. Record. Survive.”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a test subject for Axiom Corp. (hereafter Backroom Company) and explore the unknown space hidden behind the Noclip phenomenon: the “Backrooms.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple. Capture anomalous phenomena and transmit the data while staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.poster.avif?t=1782798609\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.webm?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/8b2b25020b0bf91b36afa24bda2f2a80.mp4?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Release on July 30, 2025: Go Deeper</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your exploration now goes beyond the hotel, swimming pool, and parking lot—into the foul-smelling “Sewers” and the eerie “School.”</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Exploration Mode</u>: Face the fear of getting lost in ever-changing environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story Mode</u>: Follow a fixed map and uncover the massive conspiracy Backroom Company has been hiding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.poster.avif?t=1782798609\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.webm?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/c83cd12c598b6a07579268db7e87f63d.mp4?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Filming Is Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect strange items scattered throughout the rooms and record unidentified entities to leave evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The data you capture becomes your survival score—and your key to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.poster.avif?t=1782798609\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.webm?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/480ee34c92a66ceb6eda27348fee84cd.mp4?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.poster.avif?t=1782798609\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.webm?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/3a0f7b5cc5e866b624f3cff08b039af1.mp4?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Hide or Stay Silent”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beings of the Backrooms do not welcome you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immortal entity relentlessly chases you. The locker room is your only safe haven.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monster without eyes detects even the faintest breath. Muffle your footsteps and hold your breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.poster.avif?t=1782798609\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.webm?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010460/extras/e497d8612513793ed35c573940bd89a3.mp4?t=1782798609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Work with Your Team”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your companions. But remember: more terrifying than any entity may be a teammate in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(No matter how angry you get, try not to kill your teammates on purpose. Probably.)</i></p>",
